  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DHIS2 for EMIS - expansion of pilot to 3 new countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion of DHIS2 for EMIS pilot to three new countries in addition to Uganda and Gambia; Mozambique, Togo and Sri Lanka. The aim of agreement is to develop software that sustainably can digitialise education data building on the same software used in the health sector.</narrative>
  </description>
